 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Layers are created implicitly by the first setProperty. Every setProperty is a change (even to the same value). undo reverts the most recent applied change (restoring the prior value or absence) and returns false if there is nothing to undo. redo re-applies the most recently undone change (false if none); any new change clears the redo history.",
